# T_SCRE: the location tree's keys: a lowercase letter jumping to the
# next name that starts with it; Move moving a shelf to the top level
# (the pick list opens on the room it is in, Home reaching the lead
# row); Move into a bin of the shelf itself refused in the pick list,
# which stays; a new location inside a room whose type the form takes
# from the room's first location, its Inside cleared, so its type
# becomes a room's; another inside the office saved with Inside
# untouched.
K DOWN
T s
S LJUMP
K ALT-C M
S PICKCUR
K HOME ENTER
S TOPMOVED
K HOME
T s
K ALT-C M DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S INSELF
K ESC END
T o
K INS
S INSNEW
K TAB TAB CTRL-Y TAB
S REDERIVE
K ESC
T Y
K INS
T Lamp table
K CTRL-S
S INSAVED
K ESC
